<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The heavens do God’s glory speak,</l><l>Creation vast doth show</l><l>The things of God, His character</l><l>And pow’r for man to know.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Word of God—how rich, profound,</l><l>His testimony shown;</l><l>Within the Word Thou art declared,</l><l>That God should be made known.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou, living Word, didst flesh become,</l><l>With man on earth hast trod;</l><l>And all Thy words and conduct here</l><l>Expression gave to God.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O living Word, Thou art the life,</l><l>Thou art the living light;</l><l>As life Thou dost illuminate</l><l>The Father to our sight.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>God’s judgment Thou wilt yet perform,</l><l>His righteousness make known;</l><l>This also doth expression give</l><l>That God be fully shown.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>God’s full expression, Lord, Thou art,</l><l>Himself Thou hast revealed;</l><l>Declaring all He is to man,</l><l>No more is God concealed.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
